…多くの人に試遊してもらったから大丈夫！","nextNodeIds":[705290206]},{"nodeId":705290206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":4193251794,"text":"楽器が何よりも苦手って人でも、少なくとも一曲は演奏できるから…えっと…悪くない曲を…","nextNodeIds":[705290207]},{"nodeId":705290207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":207702546,"text":"私と西風騎士団を信じて！","nextNodeIds":[705290208]},{"nodeId":705290208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":35283146,"text":"集中してリズムにのれば、きっといい曲が弾けるはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[705290209]},{"nodeId":705290209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":2121840290,"text":"風の中で美しいメロディーに耳を傾ける…そうすれば、悩みごとだってすべて忘れられる。","nextNodeIds":[705290210]},{"nodeId":705290210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1271385298,"text":"だったら、吟遊詩人は一番悩みがないはず。","nextNodeIds":[705290211]},{"nodeId":705290211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":529451938,"text":"あはは、それはどうだろ。この曲にお金を払ってくれる人はいるかなって、無意識に心配しちゃってるかも。","nextNodeIds":[705290212]},{"nodeId":705290212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":178666434,"text":"あなたの場合は…下手なりにでも、ただ楽しく演奏すればいいから。","nextNodeIds":[705290213]},{"nodeId":705290213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":699972602,"text":"あっ…今のは聞かなかったことに！このゲームの遊び方はもう分かったかな？興味があったら、ぜひやってみてね。","nextNodeIds":[705290214]},{"nodeId":705290214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":3975694170,"text":"もちろん、自分の楽器で曲を演奏することもできるよ。もし楽器を持っていなかったら、こっちで貸してあげることもできるから。","nextNodeIds":[705290215]},{"nodeId":705290215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":4087075594,"text":"へへ…たくさん楽器を用意してあるんだ。それぞれ弾き心地も違うの。","nextNodeIds":[705290216]},{"nodeId":705290216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":2746939578,"text":"まずはどの楽器で演奏したい？","nextNodeIds":[705290217,705290218,705290219]},{"nodeId":705290217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":678719074,"text":"風吹きのライアー。","nextNodeIds":[705290220]},{"nodeId":705290220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":2950964682,"text":"その楽器がいいんだね、いいよ！","nextNodeIds":[705290221]},{"nodeId":705290221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":703511514,"text":"そうだ！もう一つ伝えることがあるの！ちょっと待ってて、今ノートを見るから…","nextNodeIds":[705290222]},{"nodeId":705290222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":1347243154,"text":"えーっと…うん…みんなが素敵な曲を演奏できるように、今回は特別に「チューニング」の段階を入れたの。","nextNodeIds":[705290223]},{"nodeId":705290223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":3270052418,"text":"簡単に言うと、楽器をベストな状態に調節することだね…とても簡単だから安心して。えっと、まずは…","nextNodeIds":[705290224]},{"nodeId":705290224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":1180296578,"text":"はい！これでできた。楽器はベストな状態になったよ…譜面も用意したから。","nextNodeIds":[705290225]},{"nodeId":705290225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30046,"speakerName":"リジー","textMapHash":2681378986,"text":"あとはあなたさえ良ければ、いつでも演奏を始められる。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705290218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3118501666,"text":"鏡花の琴。","nextNodeIds":[705290220]},{"nodeId":705290219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3263584098,"text":"綺宴の鼓。","nextNodeIds":[705290220]},{"nodeId":705290204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2451687362,"text":"うまく演奏できるかな…","nextNodeIds":[705290205]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7052902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPI